reliable HP changes."},{"name":"Sunny Morning Sleep-In","text":"Elemental Mastery and reaction-related damage utility; best suited to reaction-centered builds."},{"name":"Dawning Frost","text":"Provides 55.1% CRIT DMG and up to 216 EM at R1 after hitting with Charged Attacks and Elemental Skills, making it a strong 4-star option for Nefer"},{"name":"Sacrificial Jade","text":"Battle Pass CRIT Rate, HP and EM when off-field. Its buff expires after 10 seconds on-field."},{"name":"Blackmarrow Lantern","text":"Offers Elemental Mastery and reaction bonuses. Check its acquisition source before listing it as a craftable F2P recommendation."},{"name":"Mappa Mare","text":"Craftable EM catalyst with Elemental DMG stacks after triggering a reaction."}],"a":[{"names":["Night Of The Sky'S Unveiling"],"text":"Provides 80 EM and up to 30% CRIT Rate, while increasing teamwide Lunar Reaction DMG by 10%. Nefer’s best-in-slot set for Lunar-Bloom teams.","stats":"EM · EM · CR/CD"},{"names":["Gilded Dreams"],"text":"Provides 80 EM and up to 150 additional EM or 28% ATK, boosting Nefer’s Lunar-Bloom and reaction damage.","stats":""},{"names":["Gilded Dreams","Wanderer's Troupe"],"text":"Provides 160 EM, boosting Nefer’s Lunar-Bloom damage and reaction scaling. A solid transitional option while farming her 4-piece set.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Petal to the Meta","members":["Nefer","Lauma","Nahida","Columbina"],"text":"Nefer drives Lunar-Bloom damage, Lauma provides major Lunar-Bloom buffs and Dendro RES shred, Nahida boosts EM, and Columbina supplies off-field Hydro and Lunar-Bloom buffs.","roles":["Main DPS","Buffs","EM Buffs","Lunar"]},{"name":"Petty Petals","members":["Nefer","Columbina","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Nahida"],"text":"Nefer drives Lunar-Bloom damage while Columbina supplies Hydro and reaction buffs. Kokomi adds healing and Hydro application, and Nahida shares EM.","roles":["Main DPS","Lunar","Support","EM Buffs"]},{"name":"Bloom With a View","members":["Nefer","Columbina","Lauma","Ineffa"],"text":"Nefer drives Lunar-Bloom damage, Columbina provides Hydro and Lunar buffs, Lauma amplifies Lunar-Bloom, and Ineffa adds shielding, off-field damage, and extra reaction support.","roles":["Main DPS","Lunar","Buffs","Support"]},{"name":"Broke But Blooming","members":["Nefer","Aino","Kirara","Sucrose"],"text":"Nefer drives Lunar-Bloom damage, Aino provides Hydro application and Lunar buffs, Kirara supplies Dendro application and shielding, and Sucrose boosts EM.","roles":["Main DPS","Hydro","Support","EM Build"]}],"v":"Sustain: A healer or shield improves comfort. Lauma C1 can also help sustain Nefer teams.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Nefer is a Dendro DPS who specializes in powerful Lunar Bloom damage. She thrives in dedicated teams and scales heavily with Elemental Mastery.","pros":["Massive damage","Strong single target DPS","Excellent EM scaling","Powerful reaction synergy"],"cons":["Limited team flexibility","Relies on Lunar Bloom","Wants Lauma","Struggles with Pyro aura"],"weapons":["Reliquary of Truth","Nightweaver's Looking Glass","Cashflow Supervision","Sunny Morning Sleep-In","Dawning Frost","Sacrificial Jade","Blackmarrow Lantern","Mappa Mare"],"arts":[{"sets":["Night Of The Sky'S Unveiling"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams","Wanderer's Troupe"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":"Main DPS"}],"main":["Elemental Mastery","Elemental Mastery","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["EM: 500+","Crit Rate: 40% - 50%","Crit DMG: 200% - 220%+","Energy Recharge: 100–110%+"],"vars":[{"title":"Lunar-Bloom Carry","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Reliquary of Truth","Nightweaver's Looking Glass","Sacrificial Jade"],"arts":[{"sets":["Night Of The Sky'S Unveiling"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Build EM and CRIT in line with the Lunar damage setup.","teams":"Dedicated Lunar-Bloom enabler, preferably Lauma.","when":"Focus on Nefer’s on-field Lunar-Bloom damage windows.","cond":"Reaction support is required for peak value.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Accessible Lunar-Bloom","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Dawning Frost","Sacrificial Jade"],"arts":[{"sets":["Night Of The Sky'S Unveiling"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Balance EM and CRIT; check artifact-provided CRIT.","teams":"Lunar-Bloom team with accessible catalyst choices.","when":"Lower-cost alternative preserving Nefer’s reaction-based playstyle.","cond":"Do not assume generic Bloom scaling applies unchanged.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Nagadus Emerald Sliver","Nagadus Emerald Fragment","Nagadus Emerald Chunk","Nagadus Emerald Gemstone","Radiant Antler","Teachings of Elysium","Guide to Elysium","Philosophies of Elysium","Tattered Warrant","Immaculate Warrant","Frost-Etched Warrant","Moonfall Silver","Ascended Sample: Rook","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Petal to the Meta","members":["Nefer","Lauma","Nahida","Columbina"]},{"name":"Petty Petals","members":["Nefer","Columbina","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Nahida"]},{"name":"Bloom With a View","members":["Nefer","Columbina","Lauma","Ineffa"]},{"name":"Broke But Blooming","members":["Nefer","Aino","Kirara","Sucrose"]}]}}],"title":"Nefer","el":"Dendro"}